er your membership association, online magazine, elearning sites, and more with access control to content/products and member discounts.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:57:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/woocommerce-memberships/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:23;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:35:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-printful\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:8:\"printful\";s:4:\"icon\";s:77:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Printful_Logo_icon_1-1.jpg\";s:5:\"title\";s:25:\"Printful: Print on Demand\";s:4:\"copy\";s:127:\"Sell custom embroidery and print items without inventory or upfront costs. Start or grow your ecommerce business with Printful!\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:42:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/printful/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:24;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:37:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-gift-cards\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:10:\"gift-cards\";s:4:\"icon\";s:92:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Gift_Cards_icon-marketplace-160x160-1.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:10:\"Gift Cards\";s:4:\"copy\";s:495:\"Gift Cards for WooCommerce is the official WooCommerce extension for selling prepaid, multi-purpose digital gift cards that customers redeem online. It supports Simple and Variable gift certificates, expiring codes, custom delivery dates, and multiple recipients, and lets store owners track, search, and report on issued, used, and expired codes. Unlike a coupon, it treats gift cards as prepaid balances for accurate accounting. It\'s a paid annual extension with a 30-day money-back guarantee.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:44:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/gift-cards/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:25;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:52:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-wholesale-for-woocommerce\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:25:\"wholesale-for-woocom